oplata\nCross-knee lock\nFront triangle choke (final)\nI would be happy if it consists of 4 scenes.\n\nThe high school girls look like they are having fun applying the techniques in all the scenes.\nIt would be great if we could see the facial expressions of both girls as much as possible.\n\nThe appearance of the high school girls should be\nUniform blazer + ribbon and pleated skirt\n(very mini skirt, about 20-30cm above the knee, which would easily be panty-length)\nBlack high socks and running/track sneakers\nWearing open finger gloves for fighting\nCute sports girl look with black hair in a ponytail and a slender figure.\n\nFor more information on Yuno's appearance, please visit\nhttps://twitter.com/toubunhokyuu46/status/1576577213272453121\nParker + boots in\nPlease be sure to\n\nThank you for your consideration!", "nc": 8, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@toubunhokyuu46/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1980914, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d59de7ca/uploads/origins/bc1cb72d-df51-492a-9e13-fc5243a2adcb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=64890d21a1c1cc31b40cac5231dd7d31", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d59de7ca/uploads/origins/bc1cb72d-df51-492a-9e13-fc5243a2adcb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=64890d21a1c1cc31b40cac5231dd7d31, https://si.imgix.net/d59de7ca/uploads/origins/bc1cb72d-df51-492a-9e13-fc5243a2adcb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=524469f9c68dd4ac08aa825e37ca5659 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d59de7ca/uploads/origins/bc1cb72d-df51-492a-9e13-fc5243a2adcb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1a447638bf0c150356491d7926aac582 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"s